      "content": "\"one small step at a time\"... i dont know. i just mean that it feels like there's no version of the future where i actually get to be happy. like, even if i \"win\" the fight, i'm just gonna be constantly defending myself forever. is that even worth it? just to keep existing in a world that feels like it's constantly pushing back against who i actually am?",
